" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="Vela: a candle (vela), to keep vigil (velar), and a sail. A light left on in the window. Domain and trademark check pending" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="746" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="Line" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="772" width="220" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="“Keep a light on.” · “One family. Three generations. A light kept on.”" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="772" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="Mark" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="798" width="220" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value="A small flame; lit is amber, unlit is an outline. The flame is the product's only icon that matters" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="798" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c62" value="Palette" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="824" width="220" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c63" value="Sage green #2f7d5b for actions · amber #e0a23a for the flame and the paid layer · ink #1b2430 · blue-grey neutrals. No red except for risks and true errors" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="824" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c64" value="Type" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="850" width="220" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c65" value="Newsreader for headings · Public Sans for body · IBM Plex Mono for numbers" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="850" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c66" value="Voice" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="876" width="220" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c67" value="By name, neutral over alarming, say what happens next, never “monitor”; English first, native-reviewed localisations" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d9dee6;fontColor=#1b2430;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="876" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="7_8_Pitch_deck_and_glossary" name="7.8 · Pitch deck and glossary"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold=